			"notes": "# Better with Discord\n\nFirst stable release of Better With Discord for [Better Than Adventure](https://www.betterthanadventure.net/).\n\n## Features\n\n💬 **Real-Time Chat Relay** — Bidirectional chat between Minecraft and Discord\n\n📢 **Server Notifications**\n- Player join/leave announcements\n- Death messages\n- Server start/stop events\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Better Than Adventure **7.3_04**\n- [Babric](https://github.com/Turnip-Labs/bta-fabric-instance-repo) mod loader\n\n## Installation\n\n**Installation:**\n1. Download `better_with_discord-1.0.0.jar` from the release\n2. Place in your BTA server's `mods/` folder\n3. Start the server and configure BWD in `config/better-with-discord.json`\n4. Restart the server"
		}
